{"data":{"body":"[P2] Cap finite deadline delays at the timer limit\n\nA context reporting a finite remaining time above `2 ** 31 - 1` passes the preceding guard. Node converts that timeout to 1 ms, after which this watcher rereads the long deadline and repeats, producing a continuous timer and warning loop. The existing polling and plugin deadline implementations already account for this limit. Clamp each scheduled delay to `MAX_TIMER_DELAY_MS` and add coverage for a finite deadline above it.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABDVnJ7w","finding_digest":"69c9be61ef6c9c9b4add503a6c65338f27a2b26131cc953059cdd9ccf2596d10","finding_id":"arf_v1_nhe34yppnsojwsw5ka5gyzjtr4","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts::watchdeadline::timer-delay-overflow","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts::watchdeadline::timer-delay-overflow","line":620,"observation_digest":"bcd402c93d8c46ffefc3d77f7b6f4fcdd81c8ee56e59ccb9bf7ddf9e3e27a92f","observation_id":"aro_v1_xtkafsj5rrdp736d257xw32pzx","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js/src/with-durable-execution.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-09T22:53:45Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zzouvzajtbe56majgwid2bzj7t","reviewed_base_sha":"d80f532428c15b451052841e5e6848d8f821d351","reviewed_head_sha":"d6c8d6965ca27f64379ba7b8a34139baf06977e4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":620,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1202},"record_id":"art_v1_je2az6zrg7bikaov6nx4yzjti4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-09T22:53:45Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
